@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Monospaced

title POD EVICTION TIMEOUT

start
:Node fica NotReady;
:Aguarda pod-eviction-timeout\n(default: 5 minutos);
:Pods são marcados para eviction;
